  "masking_strategy": "Embedding-as-mask paradigm with <SEG> token projected to segmentation query space",
  "pretraining": "Stage 1: Pretrain a Remote-CLIP-based multimodal LLM (Vicuna-7B + Remote-CLIP ViT-L/14) on PreGRES (over 1M QA pairs) using LoRA and next-token prediction loss. Stage 2: Fine-tune on GRES for reasoning segmentation with combined text and segmentation losses.",
